00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:35.490
Oh, for sure.
我们的特技协调员是沃利·克劳德，他的儿子肖恩·克劳德是艾德的特技替身。

487
00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:43.110
Our stunt coordinator was Wally Crowder and his son, Sean Crowder, was Ed's stunt double.
埃里克·索尔克是迈克尔的特技替身，斯科特·莱瓦是德怀特的替身。

488
00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:48.530
Eric Solke was Michael's stunt double and Scott Leva was Dwight's double.
但在他们爬上那辆冷藏卡车之前，都是我们演员自己演的。

489
00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:53.770
But until they were up on that refrigerator truck, it was all our guys.
即使是他们在停车场跑过车顶的那场戏。

490
00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:57.750
Even that scene when they're running across the cars in the parking lot.
没错。

491
00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:58.490
Yeah.
那都是我们演员本人。

492
00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.330
Those were our real guys.
事实上，我猜他们还把那些车的一些引擎盖踩凹了。

493
00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:04.230
And in fact, I guess they dented some of the hoods of those cars.
还得进行维修。

494
00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.010
They had to be repaired.
但跳下卡车落入纸箱的人确实是肖恩·克劳德。

495
00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:11.110
But it was Sean Crowder who jumps off that truck into the cardboard box.
那个箱子里装满了泡沫橡胶。

496
00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:14.050
The box was full of foam rubber.
我猜他们准备的物资足够拍三次。

497
00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.170
I guess they had enough supplies to do three takes.
他们只拍了两次，剪辑时用了第一次的镜头。

498
00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:22.230
They only did two takes and they used the first one in editing.
他完成得非常完美。

499
00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:23.530
He nailed it.
完美。

500
00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:24.330
Nailed it.
太完美了。

501
00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:26.130
Leah, I love that question.
莉亚，我很喜欢这个问题。

502
00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:30.130
I love always finding out the behind the scenes of how they did all the stunts.
我一直很喜欢了解那些特技背后的拍摄花絮。

503
00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.870
So thanks for sending that in.
所以谢谢你发来这个问题。

504
00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:36.630
So listen, one more thing about parkour before we get into this episode.
听着，在进入本集正题之前，关于跑酷还有一件事要说。

505
00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:42.190
Paul reminded me that after we shot this cold open, do you remember this?
保罗提醒我，我们拍完那个开场戏之后，你还记得吗？

506
00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:51.230
Our camera assistants, Chris and Ed, and some of the other crew guys would walk around the stage and shout parkour from time to time.
我们的摄影助理克里斯和埃德，还有其他一些工作人员，会时不时在片场走来走去，大喊“跑酷”。

507
00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:54.990
Like when he told me that, I was like, oh yes, I remember that.
他跟我提起的时候，我心想，噢对，我记得那件事。

508
00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:55.970
It would just be like, parkour.
大家就会喊，跑酷。

509
00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.550
I remember we all were doing it.
我记得我们当时都在玩这个梗。

510
00:21:58.670 --> 00:21:58.810
Yeah.
是啊。

511
00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:01.550
Like we would open the fridge and go, parkour.
比如我们打开冰箱，也会喊，跑酷。

512
00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:02.470
Yeah.
没错。

513
00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:04.630
Okay.
好吧。

514
00:22:05.150 --> 00:22:06.550
That's all my parkour stuff.
关于跑酷的事就这些了。

515
00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:07.550
I liked it.
我挺喜欢的。

516
00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:11.150
Well, this episode starts with a little bit of hazing.
这一集开头有一点点欺负新人的桥段。

517
00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:12.110
Yeah.
是啊。

518
00:22:12.110 --> 00:22:14.690
We have interns, summer interns.
我们有实习生，暑期实习生。

519
00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:18.310
We didn't film them all summer, but here they are on their last day.
我们并没有拍他们整个暑假，但这是他们最后一天上班时的样子。

520
00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:18.710
Yeah.
没错。

521
00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:20.830
We're going to get them on their last day.
我们要在他们最后一天整蛊他们。

522
00:22:21.010 --> 00:22:26.770
Dwight asked them for a cup of water, which he then chugs and then says, okay, see the files behind Kevin's desk?
德怀特让他们去倒杯水，他一口气喝光，然后说，好了，看到凯文桌子后面的那些文件了吗？

523
00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:32.470
I want you to put them all in random order and then come back for your next assignment concerning their order.
我要你们把它们全部打乱顺序，然后回来听关于排序的下一个任务。

524
00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:38.010
Can I just tell you that this hazing continued throughout the episode, but it was deleted?
我能告诉你吗，这种欺负新人的行为在这一集里其实还有后续，但被删减了。

525
00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:38.950
Oh.
噢。

526
00:22:39.270 --> 00:22:39.690
Yes.
是的。

527
00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:44.050
As it continues, you see Ryan having them make a bunch of photocopies for him.
后续剧情里，你还能看到瑞安让他们帮他复印一大堆文件。

528
00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:47.650
One of the interns is like, you know, you're not supposed to talk to us.
其中一个实习生说，你知道的，你不应该跟我们说话。

529
00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:54.330
And then it cuts to Dwight saying, yes, I've been managing the interns since Ryan's incident.
然后镜头切到德怀特说，没错，自从瑞安出事后，我就一直在管理这些实习生。

530
00:22:55.310 --> 00:23:01.450
And then we find out that Ryan's incident is he had him go to the bank and get a couple hundred dollars in pennies
然后我们发现瑞安出的事是他让实习生去银行换了几百美元的硬币，

531
00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:07.190
and made them spread them all out on the conference room table to have them search for rare old coins.
并让他们把硬币全摊在会议室的桌子上，让他们去寻找稀有的旧硬币。

532
00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:09.750
So then Dwight gets put in charge of them.
所以后来德怀特就负责管他们了。

533
00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:13.050
That feels like something Dwight would make them do, actually.
说实话，这听起来确实像是德怀特会让他们做的事。

534
00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:13.750
I know.
我知道。

535
00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:16.530
Ryan's like, how is that any worse than what Dwight made them do?
瑞安说，这和德怀特让他们做的事比起来，又有什么区别呢？

536
00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:18.050
And here's what Dwight had them do.
这就是德怀特让他们做的事。

537
00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:24.290
He set up an inter-office messaging system where if you had a message, he would write it on a note
他建立了一个办公室内部通讯系统，如果你有消息要传达，他会写在纸条上，

538
00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:28.730
and then he would make the intern walk it over, let's say, to Andy or to Phyllis.
然后让实习生走过去，比如送到安迪或者菲利斯那里。

539
00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:32.690
And so these interns were just standing by waiting for Dwight to write a note
所以这些实习生就站在旁边等着德怀特写纸条，

540
00:23:32.690 --> 00:23:35.650
that then they would have to walk over to whatever department.
然后他们就得把纸条送到各个部门去。

541
00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:36.530
Hmm.
嗯。

542
00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:38.550
So there was a lot of intern hazing.
所以有很多欺负实习生的戏份。

543
00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:39.230
It's deleted.
都被删了。

544
00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:40.630
It's on the DVDs.
在DVD里能看到。

545
00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:43.430
Well, I can give you an intern breakdown.
好吧，我可以给你介绍一下实习生的情况。

546
00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:44.510
Oh, do it.
噢，快说。

547
00:23:44.510 --> 00:23:48.330
So we have Maury, who is played by Kelly E.
我们有莫里，由凯利·E饰演。

548
00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:48.830
Miata.
米亚塔。

549
00:23:49.670 --> 00:23:54.310
Angela, he was born the year I graduated from high school.
安吉拉，他出生那年我正好高中毕业。

550
00:23:54.470 --> 00:23:55.790
Oh, well, there's that.
噢，原来是这样。

551
00:23:56.250 --> 00:23:57.990
He's now 30 years old.
他现在30岁了。

552
00:23:58.130 --> 00:23:58.930
He's a young'un.
他还是个年轻人呢。

553
00:23:59.310 --> 00:23:59.870
Yeah.
是啊。

554
00:24:00.590 --> 00:24:02.950
I found that humbling.
我觉得这让我深受触动。

555
00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:03.470
Well.
好吧。

556
00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:06.430
Megan was played by Elvie YoSt.
梅根的扮演者是埃尔维·约斯特。

557
00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:08.350
She goes by just Elvie now.
她现在只用埃尔维这个名字。

558
00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:13.170
She has been in the TV series Resident Alien and Mildred Pierce.
她曾出演过电视剧《外星居民》和《幻世浮生》。

559
00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:16.690
And then Eric was played by Max Carver.
然后埃里克的扮演者是马克斯·卡维尔。

560
00:24:16.910 --> 00:24:23.990
Now, Max would go on to play a recurring role on Desperate Housewives as Preston Scavo.
后来，马克斯在《绝望主妇》中饰演了普雷斯顿·斯卡沃，这是一个常驻角色。

561
00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:26.230
Oh, you love Desperate Housewives.
噢，你很喜欢《绝望主妇》吧。

562
00:24:26.410 --> 00:24:27.090
Oh, yes.
噢，是的。

563
00:24:27.270 --> 00:24:28.710
He was on with his twin brother.
他和他的双胞胎兄弟一起出演了那部剧。

564
00:24:28.930 --> 00:24:32.890
He has since been on The Leftovers and the series Teen Wolf.
此后，他还出演了《守望尘世》和《少狼》系列剧。

565
00:24:33.450 --> 00:24:37.590
When I saw him on Desperate Housewives, I was like, it's the intern!
当我在《绝望主妇》里看到他时，我心想，这不是那个实习生吗！

566
00:24:37.830 --> 00:24:38.770
I know him!
我认识他！

567
00:24:38.770 --> 00:24:43.850
I, like, was so geeky that I had a connection to someone on Desperate Housewives.
我当时简直像个书呆子一样，因为我竟然和《绝望主妇》里的演员有交集。

568
00:24:44.590 --> 00:24:46.790
So I slid into his DMs.
所以我给他发了私信。

569
00:24:46.990 --> 00:24:47.830
Did you really?
你真的发了吗？

570
00:24:47.970 --> 00:24:48.530
I did.
我发了。

571
00:24:48.750 --> 00:24:53.750
And he was nice enough to send in some audio clips about what it was like to be an intern
他非常友好，发来了一些音频片段，讲述了作为实习生在我们的节目中

572
00:24:53.750 --> 00:24:54.450
on our show.
工作是什么样的体验。

573
00:24:54.830 --> 00:24:58.370
And, of course, we had to ask, how did he get his job on The Office?
当然，我们必须问问他，他是怎么得到《办公室》那份工作的？

574
00:24:58.370 --> 00:24:59.790
Here's what he had to say.
听听他是怎么说的。

575
00:25:00.850 --> 00:25:02.230
Hey, it's Max Carver here.
嘿，我是马克斯·卡维尔。

576
00:25:02.370 --> 00:25:04.230
I'm super happy to be on the show.
非常高兴能上这个节目。

577
00:25:04.650 --> 00:25:07.350
I remember I went in for casting for The Office.
我记得当时我去参加《办公室》的试镜。

578
00:25:08.830 --> 00:25:12.610
And I'd really, I'd never had any experience with comedy at the time.
那时候我真的，真的没有任何喜剧表演经验。

579
00:25:12.610 --> 00:25:19.590
I just, I just read it and thought, you know, I was going and being an intern.
我只是，我只是读了剧本，心想，你知道，我要去演一个实习生。

580
00:25:20.470 --> 00:25:22.550
And the casting process was fun.
试镜过程很有趣。

581
00:25:22.710 --> 00:25:26.790
I remember Allison was so sweet and we just had a laugh.
我记得艾莉森人特别好，我们当时聊得很开心。

582
00:25:27.310 --> 00:25:30.310
I read it a couple times and then I was so excited.
我读了几遍剧本，然后感到非常兴奋。

583
00:25:30.310 --> 00:25:31.770
I couldn't believe I got the job.
我简直不敢相信我得到了这份工作。

584
00:25:31.930 --> 00:25:34.490
It was one of the first jobs I ever got in Hollywood.
那是我在好莱坞得到的第一份工作之一。

585
00:25:35.010 --> 00:25:40.130
I was well aware of the show and a huge fan of both the British version and the American
我当时很了解这部剧，也是英版和美版《办公室》的

586
00:25:40.130 --> 00:25:40.530
version.
忠实粉丝。

587
00:25:40.530 --> 00:25:44.310
So, it was a dream come true.
所以，这简直是梦想成真。

588
00:25:45.350 --> 00:25:49.750
So, Angela, when I hear his voice in that audio clip, that is exactly how I remember him
所以，安吉拉，当我听到那段音频里他的声音时，那和我记忆中他在片场的样子

589
00:25:49.750 --> 00:25:50.290
on set.
一模一样。

590
00:25:50.470 --> 00:25:52.550
He was just kind and...
他当时既善良又……

591
00:25:52.550 --> 00:25:53.510
They were really sweet.
他们真的都很贴心。

592
00:25:53.650 --> 00:25:54.370
All really nice.
所有人都非常好。

593
00:25:54.370 --> 00:25:56.250
They were just young, nice, sweet folks.
他们就是一群年轻、友善、可爱的人。

594
00:25:56.450 --> 00:26:01.250
Well, I also asked him, did he have any memories from his time on set?
嗯，我还问了他，对在片场的那段时光有什么记忆吗？

595
00:26:01.430 --> 00:26:02.230
Here's what he said.
听听他怎么说。

596
00:26:03.110 --> 00:26:09.770
One of the memories I have from being on set is that everyone there is just an improv master.
我在片场的一段记忆是，那里的每个人都是即兴表演大师。

597
00:26:10.530 --> 00:26:15.830
So, there's just not enough time on TV for all the amazing stuff that we saw.
所以，电视节目里根本没有足够的时间来呈现我们所看到的那些精彩内容。

598
00:26:16.030 --> 00:26:19.770
I think we probably shot an hour worth of content.
我想我们可能拍摄了一个小时的内容。

599
00:26:20.270 --> 00:26:22.930
And unfortunately, you only get to see 22 minutes.
但遗憾的是，你们只能看到22分钟。

600
00:26:23.250 --> 00:26:29.350
But at one point, I remember Dwight was lecturing us interns about an experience he had with
不过有一次，我记得德怀特在向我们这些实习生传授他的一次经历，关于

601
00:26:29.350 --> 00:26:33.350
a lobster, which is a lobster for the record.
一只龙虾，顺便说一下，那确实是一只龙虾。

602
00:26:33.710 --> 00:26:37.570
And I just, I could not keep a straight face.
我当时真的，我根本没法忍住不笑。

603
00:26:37.570 --> 00:26:41.870
I don't think that scene ever made it to air, just because every time the camera panned over
我觉得那一幕最后没能播出，就是因为每次镜头扫到

604
00:26:41.870 --> 00:26:47.110
to me, I was, I was, I just couldn't keep a straight face.
我的时候，我真的，我真的就是忍不住笑场。

605
00:26:48.490 --> 00:26:50.290
But Dwight is so funny.
但德怀特真的太搞笑了。

606
00:26:50.650 --> 00:26:54.370
Rain, Rain just knew exactly what would make me laugh.
雷恩，雷恩他完全知道怎么逗我笑。

607
00:26:54.530 --> 00:27:00.370
So, at every take, he just turned it up another notch and another notch and another notch.
所以每次重拍，他都会变本加厉，一次比一次更夸张。

608
00:27:00.490 --> 00:27:02.250
I don't think he even cared if we got the scene.
我觉得他根本不在乎我们能不能拍完那一幕。

609
00:27:02.370 --> 00:27:03.590
He just wanted to make me laugh.
他就是想逗我笑。

610
00:27:04.050 --> 00:27:06.210
So, I will, I will never forget that.
所以，我永远都不会忘记那件事。

611
00:27:07.750 --> 00:27:10.370
That scene is in the deleted scenes on the DVD.
那一幕在DVD的删减片段里。

612
00:27:10.830 --> 00:27:12.290
And it's very funny.
而且非常搞笑。

613
00:27:12.770 --> 00:27:16.630
You know, Dwight is basically trying to impart his wisdom to the interns.
你知道，德怀特基本上是在试图向实习生们传授他的智慧。

614
00:27:16.630 --> 00:27:18.010
And he has a huge speech.
他有一大段演讲。

615
00:27:18.010 --> 00:27:18.950
I'm going to paraphrase it.
我来复述一下大意。

616
00:27:19.030 --> 00:27:23.790
But he's like, I'm going to tell you a story about a young salesman who went out to a restaurant
他大概是说，我要给你们讲个故事，讲一个年轻的推销员去餐厅吃饭，

617
00:27:23.790 --> 00:27:28.510
and he ordered a lobster because he had never had lobster before.
他点了一只龙虾，因为他以前从没吃过龙虾。

618
00:27:28.690 --> 00:27:30.910
And he mispronounced it and called it a lobster.
结果他读错了发音，把它叫成了“a lobster”。

619
00:27:31.570 --> 00:27:33.850
And he goes on and on to tell this story.
然后他就滔滔不绝地讲起了这个故事。

620
00:27:34.010 --> 00:27:34.850
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

621
00:27:35.050 --> 00:27:35.950
Oh, my gosh.
我的天。

622
00:27:36.030 --> 00:27:36.690
That's amazing.
太绝了。

623
00:27:37.150 --> 00:27:44.630
Well, the last question I asked Max was, does he ever get recognized for being the intern,
好吧，我问马克斯的最后一个问题是，他有没有因为演过《办公室》里的实习生

624
00:27:44.830 --> 00:27:46.170
Eric, on The Office?
埃里克而被认出来？

625
00:27:46.930 --> 00:27:51.090
In terms of being recognized, yeah.
说到被认出来，有的。

626
00:27:51.430 --> 00:27:56.350
You know, I think fans of The Office are probably the most hardcore fans in the world.
你知道，我觉得《办公室》的粉丝可能是世界上最铁杆的粉丝了。

627
00:27:56.710 --> 00:27:58.970
I've worked on a number of other shows.
我参与过很多其他节目的制作。

628
00:27:59.690 --> 00:28:03.230
But The Office is the one that keeps coming up.
但《办公室》总是会被人提起。

629
