00:44:45.360 --> 00:44:51.600
Here are the 12 most commonly occurring letters in the English language, from most to leaSt.
这是英语中出现频率最高的12个字母，按从高到低排列。

979
00:44:52.020 --> 00:44:52.700
E.
E。

980
00:44:53.040 --> 00:44:53.720
Okay.
好的。

981
00:44:53.980 --> 00:44:54.240
T.
T。

982
00:44:54.960 --> 00:44:55.580
A.
A。

983
00:44:56.340 --> 00:44:57.020
O.
O。

984
00:44:57.420 --> 00:44:58.100
I.
I。

985
00:44:58.800 --> 00:44:59.480
N.
N。

986
00:45:00.620 --> 00:45:05.360
S-H-R-D-L-U.
S-H-R-D-L-U。

987
00:45:06.020 --> 00:45:10.100
So, if you're ever on Wheel of Fortune, and you're going to buy a vowel, buy an E.
所以，如果你哪天上了《幸运轮》，要买元音字母的话，就买E。

988
00:45:10.360 --> 00:45:10.720
Okay.
好的。

989
00:45:11.000 --> 00:45:14.100
If you're going to guess a consonant, the first one you should guess is T.
如果你要猜辅音字母，第一个该猜的就是T。

990
00:45:14.220 --> 00:45:14.320
T.
T。

