1015
00:46:09.560 --> 00:46:20.520
But the five most difficult words to guess in a word guessing game are jazz, buzz, two Zs,
但在猜词游戏中，最难猜的五个词是 jazz（爵士乐）、buzz（嗡嗡声），两个Z，

