好吧，现在吉姆和帕姆要被叫去校长办公室了。

1395
01:03:51.600 --> 01:03:55.820
Michael is devastated that they did not tell him first, that they did not tell him sooner.
迈克尔很受打击，因为他们没有先告诉他，没有早点告诉他。

1396
01:03:56.280 --> 01:03:58.380
They only just told their parents.
他们才刚刚告诉了各自的父母。

1397
01:03:58.800 --> 01:04:01.920
In the shooting draft, the line read like this.
在拍摄剧本中，台词是这样的。

1398
01:04:02.460 --> 01:04:04.100
Did you piss on a stick?
你是在验孕棒上撒尿了吗？

1399
01:04:05.940 --> 01:04:08.460
And I guess on the day they changed it to P.
我猜拍摄当天他们把它改成了“P”。

1400
01:04:08.860 --> 01:04:11.940
But when I read that in the shooting draft, it was so jarring.
但当我在拍摄剧本里读到那句时，觉得太刺耳了。

1401
01:04:12.080 --> 01:04:14.960
I'm like, why would he say, did you piss on a stick?
我就在想，他为什么要说“你往验孕棒上撒尿了吗”？

1402
01:04:15.680 --> 01:04:18.420
Well, Michael has done something, guys.
好吧，迈克尔确实干了件好事，伙计们。

1403
01:04:18.420 --> 01:04:22.120
Anyways, he has called Stanley's wife.
总之，他给斯坦利的妻子打了电话。

1404
01:04:22.700 --> 01:04:24.900
This scene is so brilliant.
这一幕真是太精彩了。

1405
01:04:25.680 --> 01:04:31.840
When Aaron says, Terry Hudson's on the line, you guys, your faces are like, you called her?
当亚伦说“泰瑞·哈德森在线上”时，你们的表情就像是“你竟然给她打了电话？”

1406
01:04:32.020 --> 01:04:33.320
And Michael's like, I got this.
而迈克尔却说“这事儿我能搞定”。

1407
01:04:33.420 --> 01:04:34.040
I can do it.
我能行。

1408
01:04:34.200 --> 01:04:36.220
I'll tell her I'm redecorating my condo.
我会告诉她我正在重新装修我的公寓。

1409
01:04:36.300 --> 01:04:38.080
And they're like, no, Michael, don't.
他们就说“不，迈克尔，别这样”。

1410
01:04:38.140 --> 01:04:39.160
You guys are like, don't.
你们当时就像是“别这样”。

1411
01:04:39.580 --> 01:04:39.980
Don't.
别这样。

1412
01:04:39.980 --> 01:04:41.180
But he has this whole thing.
但他有一整套计划。

1413
01:04:41.340 --> 01:04:44.880
It's going to have to play out over months where he's redecorating the condo.
这得花上几个月的时间，假装他在重新装修公寓。

1414
01:04:44.980 --> 01:04:48.060
They're going to get quotes, but then they're going to get an argument about the cost of
他们会去询价，然后会因为东西的成本问题

1415
01:04:48.060 --> 01:04:48.240
things.
发生争执。

1416
01:04:48.360 --> 01:04:50.480
And eventually he's just going to have to call it all off.
最后他只能把这一切都取消。

1417
01:04:50.660 --> 01:04:53.960
And he literally is like, I've got this.
他当时真的就是那种“这事儿我能搞定”的态度。

1418
01:04:54.260 --> 01:04:56.560
And Pam is like, Michael, please don't.
帕姆说“迈克尔，求你别这样”。

1419
01:04:56.720 --> 01:05:00.100
Michael picks up the phone and says, hey, what up, Cynthia?
迈克尔拿起电话说“嘿，怎么了，辛西娅？”

1420
01:05:00.100 --> 01:05:04.440
Cynthia, I mean, just amazing.
辛西娅，我的天，真是太绝了。

1421
01:05:04.820 --> 01:05:07.920
Jim starts to walk over and Michael is waving him off like, I got it.
吉姆走过来，迈克尔挥手让他走开，意思是“我能搞定”。

1422
01:05:07.980 --> 01:05:08.420
I got it.
我能搞定。

1423
01:05:08.520 --> 01:05:10.680
And then he goes, hold on a second, Cynthia.
然后他说“等一下，辛西娅”。

1424
01:05:11.460 --> 01:05:13.620
And then Jim just hangs up the phone.
接着吉姆直接把电话挂了。

1425
01:05:14.720 --> 01:05:16.940
We had a fan question from Kelsey S.
我们收到一个来自亚利桑那州钱德勒市凯尔西·S的粉丝提问，

1426
01:05:17.080 --> 01:05:20.500
from Chandler, Arizona, who says, this is my absolute
她说“这是我绝对

1427
01:05:20.500 --> 01:05:22.260
favorite episode of all time.
最喜欢的一集”。

1428
01:05:22.280 --> 01:05:24.000
This is my comfort episode.
这是我的治愈剧集。

1429
01:05:24.220 --> 01:05:25.740
I watch it all of the time.
我经常看这一集。

1430
01:05:25.740 --> 01:05:30.640
And I need to know if the scene where Michael answers the call from Terry, was it all improvised
我想知道迈克尔接听泰瑞电话的那一幕，是完全即兴发挥的

1431
01:05:30.640 --> 01:05:31.720
or was it scripted?
还是照着剧本演的？

1432
01:05:32.380 --> 01:05:36.680
Everything from Steve's reaction to his hand movements on the phone is hilarious.
从史蒂夫的反应到他打电话时的手部动作，一切都太搞笑了。

1433
01:05:36.680 --> 01:05:37.700
And I love it.
我太喜欢了。

1434
01:05:38.480 --> 01:05:42.220
This entire scene played out exactly as scripted.
整个场景完全是按照剧本演的。

1435
01:05:42.460 --> 01:05:43.560
Minus the piss.
除了关于尿的那句。

1436
01:05:43.800 --> 01:05:44.720
Minus the piss.
除了关于尿的那句。

1437
01:05:44.960 --> 01:05:46.540
That's the only thing that changed.
那是唯一改动的地方。

1438
01:05:46.880 --> 01:05:48.260
It is 100% on the page.
百分之百是剧本里写的。

1439
01:05:48.880 --> 01:05:49.780
Guess what?
你猜怎么着？

1440
01:05:50.240 --> 01:05:53.760
Terry was already suspicious about this affair.
泰瑞本来就怀疑有外遇这回事。

1441
01:05:53.760 --> 01:05:57.300
And this, I guess, proves it.
我想，这正好证明了这一点。

1442
01:05:58.140 --> 01:06:00.940
Stanley is going to vandalize Michael's car.
斯坦利要去破坏迈克尔的车。

1443
01:06:01.320 --> 01:06:06.900
Stanley takes a crowbar to Michael's car and destroys it.
斯坦利拿着撬棍砸了迈克尔的车，把它毁了。

1444
01:06:07.060 --> 01:06:09.860
We had a couple of fan questions about this.
我们收到几个关于此事的粉丝提问。

1445
01:06:10.320 --> 01:06:11.940
One from Rohit R.
一个来自俄克拉荷马州诺曼市的罗希特·R。

1446
01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:12.880
in Norman, Oklahoma.
提问是：

1447
01:06:12.880 --> 01:06:17.120
How much did the scene of Stanley smashing Michael's car cost?
斯坦利砸迈克尔车的那场戏花了多少钱？

1448
01:06:18.260 --> 01:06:19.480
And Monica F.
还有来自北卡罗来纳州的莫妮卡·F说，

1449
01:06:19.680 --> 01:06:20.940
from North Carolina said,
“我觉得特别好笑的是，

1450
01:06:21.600 --> 01:06:26.980
It's so funny to me that Stanley had enough time to put on his sunglasses before smashing Michael's car.
斯坦利在砸迈克尔的车之前，竟然还有时间戴上墨镜。”

1451
01:06:27.640 --> 01:06:30.960
Well, guys, Leslie did this smashing.
伙计们，莱斯利这下砸得真棒。

1452
01:06:31.280 --> 01:06:33.000
Randy said he had a very good time.
兰迪说他玩得很开心。

1453
01:06:33.160 --> 01:06:33.980
I would, too.
我也一样。

1454
01:06:34.140 --> 01:06:35.080
I would, too.
我也一样。

1455
01:06:35.440 --> 01:06:39.920
He said that they had to establish him wearing the sunglasses earlier in the episode
他说他们必须在这一集早些时候就铺垫他戴墨镜的镜头，

1456
01:06:39.920 --> 01:06:45.260
so that during this scene, he would have eye protection in case anything flew up in his eyes.
这样在这一幕里，万一有东西飞进他眼睛里，他就有护目镜了。

1457
01:06:46.060 --> 01:06:49.500
Randy said he smashed the heck out of that car.
兰迪说他把那辆车砸得稀烂。

1458
01:06:49.780 --> 01:06:50.780
It was a one-er.
那是一镜到底的。

1459
01:06:51.240 --> 01:06:52.000
Just one take.
只拍了一次。

1460
01:06:52.280 --> 01:06:55.160
It cost over $4,000 to repair.
维修费超过了4000美元。

1461
01:06:55.520 --> 01:06:56.920
I don't doubt it.
我一点也不怀疑。

1462
01:06:57.000 --> 01:06:59.760
When he called up and started to mess with the convertible top?
当他打电话开始摆弄敞篷车顶的时候？

1463
01:07:00.020 --> 01:07:00.280
Yeah.
没错。

1464
01:07:00.520 --> 01:07:02.040
I was like, oh, no.
我当时心想，噢，不。

1465
01:07:02.340 --> 01:07:02.820
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1466
01:07:02.820 --> 01:07:03.920
That's some cha-ching.
那可真是一笔巨款。

1467
01:07:04.720 --> 01:07:07.200
Well, guys, that's basically the end of this episode.
好了，伙计们，这一集基本上就到这里了。

1468
01:07:07.340 --> 01:07:10.420
The interns have a little talking head at the end
实习生们在结尾有个简短的采访，

1469
01:07:10.420 --> 01:07:15.120
where we find out that Michael just called them Jet Li, Julia Stiles, and Alan Thicke.
我们发现迈克尔刚才分别叫他们李连杰、朱丽娅·斯蒂尔斯和艾伦·锡克。

1470
01:07:15.220 --> 01:07:19.960
And that Eric never really learned how many pieces of paper were in a ream of paper.
而且埃里克一直没搞清楚一令纸到底有多少张。

1471
01:07:21.940 --> 01:07:25.480
In the very end credits at 21 minutes, 34 seconds,
在21分34秒的片尾字幕里，

1472
01:07:25.700 --> 01:07:28.580
Randy Cordray pointed something out to us, and I want to share it to you.
兰迪·科德雷向我们指出了某样东西，我想分享给你们。

1473
01:07:28.580 --> 01:07:34.220
We see the name of our new unit production manager for season six, Steve Burgess.
我们看到了第六季新任制片经理史蒂夫·伯吉斯的名字。

1474
01:07:34.720 --> 01:07:42.200
Steve was a very old and dear friend of Randy, and I loved Steve Burgess so much.
史蒂夫是兰迪的老朋友了，我也非常喜欢史蒂夫·伯吉斯。

1475
01:07:42.200 --> 01:07:45.360
He went on to be our line producer in the last seasons.
他后来成了我们最后几季的执行制片人。

1476
01:07:45.600 --> 01:07:49.180
We adore him, and it was so fun to finally see his name.
我们很敬重他，能最终看到他的名字真是太棒了。

1477
01:07:49.360 --> 01:07:54.060
Randy said when he brought him on board that Steve's contributions behind the scenes were immeasurable.
兰迪说，当他邀请史蒂夫加入时，史蒂夫在幕后的贡献是不可估量的。

1478
01:07:54.380 --> 01:07:56.800
Yes, and we are still in touch with Steve today.
是的，我们至今仍与史蒂夫保持着联系。

1479
01:07:56.800 --> 01:08:01.560
So when we get to those episodes where he was the line producer, we're going to get to hear from him.
所以当我们讲到他担任执行制片人的那些剧集时，我们就能听到他的声音了。

1480
01:08:02.020 --> 01:08:02.100
Yay!
太棒了！

1481
01:08:03.420 --> 01:08:05.460
Ah, well, that's gossip.
啊，好吧，那是八卦。

1482
01:08:05.900 --> 01:08:11.100
Do you think I'll end up in the gossip magazines because of my soup dreams with Brad Pitt?
你觉得我会因为和布拉德·皮特一起喝汤的梦而登上八卦杂志吗？

1483
01:08:11.360 --> 01:08:12.800
Would that be so weird?
那会很奇怪吗？

1484
01:08:12.980 --> 01:08:15.060
That would be such a full circle moment.
那将是一个完美的闭环时刻。

1485
01:08:15.320 --> 01:08:15.800
I know.
我知道。

1486
01:08:15.980 --> 01:08:17.220
Who's going to write about it?
谁会写这个呢？

1487
01:08:17.320 --> 01:08:18.040
I don't know.
我不知道。

1488
01:08:18.460 --> 01:08:19.440
Maybe no one.
也许没人会写。

1489
01:08:19.520 --> 01:08:20.900
No one cares about my soup.
没人关心我的汤。

1490
01:08:21.080 --> 01:08:22.000
Your fake soup?
你那虚构的汤？

1491
01:08:22.660 --> 01:08:23.940
My fake soup!
我那虚构的汤！

1492
01:08:23.960 --> 01:08:25.140
With Brad Pitt!
和布拉德·皮特一起喝的！

1493
01:08:27.060 --> 01:08:32.580
Listen, if we ever hear from Brad Pitt about the fake soup, I will be so excited.
听着，如果我们哪天真的因为这碗虚构的汤收到布拉德·皮特的消息，我会兴奋死的。

1494
01:08:32.800 --> 01:08:34.180
If we ever hear from...
如果我们哪天收到……

1495
01:08:34.180 --> 01:08:34.500
What?
什么？

1496
01:08:34.700 --> 01:08:34.920
What?
什么？

1497
01:08:34.920 --> 01:08:35.540
Oh, my gosh!
噢，天哪！

1498
01:08:36.320 --> 01:08:37.980
What if one day...
要是有一天……

1499
01:08:37.980 --> 01:08:39.140
You scared the crap out of me!
你吓死我了！

1500
01:08:39.140 --> 01:08:39.840
I'm sorry.
抱歉。

1501
01:08:39.840 --> 01:08:40.840
I'm having a dream.
我正在做梦。

1502
01:08:40.880 --> 01:08:42.560
And I'm so sorry for anyone listening.
如果有人在听的话，我深感抱歉。

1503
01:08:42.920 --> 01:08:44.540
I probably then scared you.
我大概吓到你们了。

1504
01:08:45.440 --> 01:08:53.220
What if one day we are doing Office Ladies and we get some soup delivered and it's from Brad Pitt?
如果有一天我们在录《办公室女士》，有人送来一份汤，而且是布拉德·皮特做的，会怎么样？

1505
01:08:54.040 --> 01:08:54.920
Come on.
别闹了。

1506
01:08:55.160 --> 01:08:55.700
Could that happen?
这可能发生吗？

1507
01:08:55.700 --> 01:08:56.400
And you know what?
而且你知道吗？

1508
01:08:56.560 --> 01:08:57.760
Guess who's going to deliver it?
猜猜谁会来送汤？

1509
01:08:58.360 --> 01:08:58.800
Keanu.
基努。

1510
01:09:00.420 --> 01:09:03.480
If Keanu Reeves delivered soup made by Brad Pitt.
如果基努·里维斯送来了布拉德·皮特做的汤。

1511
01:09:03.480 --> 01:09:10.740
And then all of a sudden, Idris Elba is going to, like, bring some music into it and we're going to just have, like, a soup-eating party.
然后突然之间，伊德里斯·艾尔巴又带了些音乐过来，我们就这样举办了一场喝汤派对。

1512
01:09:11.580 --> 01:09:12.900
What has just happened?
刚才发生了什么？

1513
01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:13.800
I don't know.
我不知道。

1514
01:09:14.560 --> 01:09:17.280
Well, save it for Nifty 50s!
好吧，留着在“五十年代妙趣”节目里说吧！

1515
01:09:18.600 --> 01:09:19.560
Musical review!
音乐评论！

1516
01:09:20.140 --> 01:09:23.080
And you guys, we hope you have a fantastic week.
各位，希望你们度过愉快的一周。

1517
01:09:23.080 --> 01:09:30.040
Once again, thank you to Randy Cordray, Max Carver, and all of you guys for sending in your questions and your comments.
再次感谢兰迪·科德雷、马克斯·卡弗，以及所有发来问题和评论的听众朋友们。

1518
01:09:30.040 --> 01:09:31.360
We hope you have a great week.
希望你们度过美好的一周。

1519
01:09:31.360 --> 01:09:31.980
We love you.
我们爱你们。

1520
01:09:31.980 --> 01:09:38.880
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

